          "memory": "User and Devon went to Luigi's on September 18, 2026 as planned; on the morning of September 19, 2026 Devon ate a leftover slice for breakfast and User had two slices left in the fridge, while both said the garlic knots did not survive the night with Devon eating his in the car.",
