          "memory": "Devon recommended reheating leftover Luigi's pizza in a dry pan on medium with a splash of water and lid at the end for about 5 minutes to keep the crust crispy and melt cheese without burning; User said User usually microwaves it and it goes soggy and planned to try the pan method for lunch on September 19, 2026.",
